(
    title: "Cathouse Blues",
    description: Some("A memory game in adult dress: seven women live somewhere in a sprawling neighborhood, and you must remember which houses are theirs and visit them all, while wrong doors raise alarms and the police and a mugger prowl the streets. PlayAround shipped it on a double-ender cartridge with Philly Flasher on the other end; its gender-reversed companion Gigolo sends a woman on the same rounds."),
